---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Other Specialists — Stone & Key Consulting"
  description="Other independent specialists whose expertise complements Stone & Key Consulting — including QConsul LLC, providing Responsible AI Program and Product Leadership."
>
  <section class="specialists" style="padding-top: 8rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Specialists</p>
      <h1>Other Specialists</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width: 54ch;">
        Independent specialists whose expertise complements what Stone &amp; Key
        Consulting does — people I have worked alongside or whose work I have seen,
        and would point you toward when a project needs something I don't provide.
      </p>
      <p class="disclaimer">
        These are independent firms and individuals. Listing them here is a
        recommendation, not a partnership, agency, joint venture, or any other
        formal business relationship.
      </p>

      <article class="specialist">
        <header class="specialist-head">
          <h2>
            <a href="https://qconsultai.com" rel="noopener">QConsul LLC</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="tagline">Responsible AI Program &amp; Product Leadership</p>
          <p class="meta">
            Portland, Oregon
            <span class="dot">·</span>
            <a href="https://qconsultai.com" rel="noopener">qconsultai.com</a>
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="specialist-body">
          <h3>Company overview</h3>
          <p>
            QConsul LLC provides Responsible AI Program &amp; Product Leadership,
            embedding senior leadership with executive teams to plan, govern, and
            responsibly scale agentic AI systems. QConsul connects executive
            strategy, governance, and implementation through measurable sprint
            delivery aligned with client business objectives and KPIs.
          </p>
          <p>
            Its approach, <strong>Sprint-Governed AI</strong>, brings strategy,
            prioritization, delivery, and ongoing improvement into a shared
            operating cadence. QConsul helps organizations coordinate work across
            people, AI agents, and independent specialists, translating
            responsible AI commitments into measurable business outcomes.
          </p>
          <p>
            Engagements emphasize business value, quality, and ROI per Token&trade;.
            As an Oregon Benefit Company, QConsul weighs its operating model and
            success criteria against a triple bottom line of people, planet, and
            prosperity.
          </p>

          <h3>Founder</h3>
          <div class="founder">
            <p class="founder-name">
              Karen Michael
              <span class="founder-role">Founder &amp; Principal</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              Karen Michael, Founder &amp; Principal of QConsul LLC, brings more
              than 30 years of transformation leadership across enterprise,
              public-sector, and mid-market environments. She connects business
              strategy, people, process, and technology, combining program and
              product leadership with hands-on experience building and governing
              agentic systems. Her focus is helping organizations turn AI strategy
              into governed delivery and measurable business value.
            </p>
            <p>
              She holds an M.S. in Software Engineering and advanced Scrum
              Alliance credentials (CSP-SM, CSP-PO). She also holds EnterpriseClaw
              certification in Enterprise AI Agent Leadership and has completed
              ISO/IEC 42001 Lead Implementer training.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="specialist-cta">
          <a href="https://qconsultai.com" rel="noopener" class="btn-outline">
            Visit qconsultai.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .specialists {
    min-height: 70vh;
    padding-bottom: var(--section-pad-y);
  }

  .disclaimer {
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brass-soft);
    background: rgba(200, 162, 107, 0.05);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .specialist {
    margin-top: 3.4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone-line);
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .specialist-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
  }
  .specialist-head h2 a {
    color: var(--ink-0);
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .specialist-head h2 a:hover {
    color: var(--brass);
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-1);
  }

  .meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .meta a {
    color: var(--brass);
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .meta a:hover {
    color: var(--ink-0);
  }
  .dot {
    opacity: 0.5;
    padding: 0 0.35rem;
  }

  .specialist-body {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }
  .specialist-body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brass);
    margin: 2.4rem 0 0.9rem;
  }
  .specialist-body h3:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .specialist-body p {
    color: var(--ink-1);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }
  .specialist-body strong {
    color: var(--ink-0);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brass-soft);
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
  }
  .founder-name {
    color: var(--ink-0) !important;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem !important;
  }
  .founder-role {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .specialist-cta {
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
  }
  .btn-outline {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--brass);
    border: 1px solid var(--brass-soft);
    padding: 0.65rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover {
    background: rgba(200, 162, 107, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--brass);
    color: var(--ink-0);
  }
</style>
